@startuml
title RPG Character Creator - Save or Update Character

actor "Authenticated User" as User
boundary "React Frontend" as Frontend
control "Express API" as API
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL + RLS" as Database

User -> Frontend: Choose class, name, and seven attributes
User -> Frontend: Click Save Character
Frontend -> API: PUT /api/characters/me\nAuthorization: Bearer access_token\nJSON character fields only

API -> Auth: Validate supplied access token
Auth --> API: Verified user ID or authentication failure

alt Invalid, expired, or missing token
    API --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
else Verified user
    API -> API: Validate name and catalog slugs
    API -> API: Derive user_id from verified identity

    alt Invalid input
        API --> Frontend: 400 Validation error
    else Valid input
        API -> Database: User-scoped upsert by user_id
        Database -> Database: Enforce RLS for owner\nand UNIQUE(user_id)

        alt Permission or persistence failure
            Database --> API: Error
            API --> Frontend: Safe error status/body
        else Created or updated
            Database --> API: Own character row
            API --> Frontend: 201 Created or 200 OK
        end
    end
end

Frontend --> User: Show success or safe error\nretain form draft when needed

note over API, Database
  No service-role bypass for character CRUD.
  No client-provided user_id trusted.
  Randomize changes draft only until Save.
end note

@enduml